{"id":"g2110","title":"Mixed Pollen 30C","description":"Anwendungsbeschreibung für das anthroposophische Arzneimittel Mixed Pollen 30C zur Prophylaxe und Akuttherapie der allergischen Rhinitis (Heuschnupfen).","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WELEDA UK. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Heuschnupfen "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1845","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Prophylaxe: 1 x tgl. 1 Tbl., 2–3 Mo. vor Beginn des relevanten Pollenflugs. "},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapie: Bei akuten Beschwerden bis zu 6 x tgl. 1 Tbl. im Mund zergehen lassen, ggf. ergänzt durch "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0273.html","id":"11958","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Flores Tritici comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" WELEDA Dil. 3–4 x 15 Tr."}]}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Bereits in der ersten Saison nach der Prophylaxe werden alle Heuschnupfensymptome (Rhinitis und Konjunktivitis) besser. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 1–2 J. mit Beginn wie oben beschrieben 2–3 Mo. vor dem Pollenflug, nach Ende der Pollensaison Pause. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Keine. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Noch keine ausreichenden Erfahrungen des Autors bei exogen allergischem Asthma bronchiale. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": FM. "}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}